    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">Agamidan eyes are well adjusted and adapted much like the rest of their bodies, and you can leverage a technique to observe in multiple directions freely and to also protect your eyes from your elements. When you Seek, you can scan twice as many areas with a single action, though typically this allows you to investigate one dimension while making sure you are covering the immediate area around you. Additionally, you gain a +2 circumstance bonus to your saves and DCs against visual effects or effects that can impair your vision.</span></p>"
